From: rcoster em gmail.com (Rodrigo Coster)
Date: Mon, 18 Apr 2016 13:05:46 +0000
Subject: =?utf-8?q?Re=3A_=5BR-br=5D_Agregar_n=C3=ADveis_e_converter_em_colunas?=
